---

# 🚀 Setup

## 1️⃣ Clone project

```bash id="jlwm86"
git clone <repo_url>
cd project
```

---

## 2️⃣ Install Ollama

Download:
https://ollama.com

---

## 3️⃣ Pull model

```bash id="jlwm87"
ollama pull qwen2.5:7b
```

---

## 4️⃣ (Optional) Custom model storage

Windows:

```bash id="jlwm88"
setx OLLAMA_MODELS "L:\Downloads\OllamaModels"
```

---

## 5️⃣ Run Docker

```bash id="jlwm89"
docker compose up
```

---

